## Why This Is Asked
Tests understanding of per-tenant ordering under backpressure, dynamic scaling, and late message handling in real-time distributed systems.

## Key Concepts
- Per-room in-order delivery with concurrent producers
- Bounded buffers and global queue backpressure management
- Dynamic worker scaling with thread-safety guarantees
- Late message policies and deduplication strategies

## Code Example
```javascript
// Core structure for per-room buffers and dispatcher
class RoomBuffer {
  constructor(limit) {
    this.queue = [];
    this.limit = limit;
    this.nextSequence = 0;
  }

  push(message) {
    if (this.queue.length >= this.limit) return false;
    this.queue.push(message);
    return true;
  }
}
```
